# JOURNEY · growing the aquarium: buy a tank, name it, switch to it and back.

clear
run /shop
key enter
select Fishtank
key enter
expect Price/unit
snap the tank catalogue
key enter
type Annex
snap the naming popup
key enter
key esc
key esc
key esc
absent Price/unit

run /fishtanks
expect Annex
snap the new tank is listed
key esc

run /switch "Annex"
expect Annex
snap the status bar names the tank you are in
run /switch "Fishtank"
absent Annex
